  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Alcohol Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A long-lasting, non-comedogenic, and alcohol-free setting spray that hydrates and locks in your makeup for 16 hours with a natural-dewy finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skin Type: </strong>Oily, Dry, and Sensitive</p><p><br style=\" border-box; outline: 0px;\"></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating, Long-Wearing</p><p><br style=\" border-box; outline: 0px;\"></p><p><strong>Formulation: </strong>Mist </p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong><br>- Hydrolyzed Corn Starch: Sets makeup with a flexible, comfortable feel on the skin.</p><p>- Humectants (Propanediol and Glycogen): Support skin hydration and provide a fresh, dewy glow.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong></p><p >- Apply as your daily final step for makeup that lasts 16 hours.&nbsp;</p><p>- With closed eyes, hold the bottle 5-8 inches away from the face.</p><p>- Mist evenly over the entire face.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Hydrolyzed Corn Starch: Sets makeup with a flexible, comfortable feel on the skin.<br>-Humectants (Propendial and Glycogen): Support skin hydration and provide a fresh, dewy glow.<br>-Mandarin Orange Extract: Supports skin barrier protection from city stressors like pollution.<br><br>Aqua/Water/Eau, Propanediol, Hydrolyzed Corn Starch, Pentylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Betaine, Glycerin, Citric Acid, Citrus Reticulata (Tangerine) Peel Extract, Glycogen, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, Sodium Hydroxide.</div></details>",
